---
title: Resilience Patterns
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant CB as Circuit Breaker
    participant Retry as Retry Strategy
    participant Service
    participant Fallback
    
    Client->>CB: Request
    
    alt Circuit Closed
        CB->>Retry: Forward Request
        loop Retry Logic
            Retry->>Service: Attempt
            alt Success
                Service-->>Retry: Response
                Retry-->>CB: Success
                CB-->>Client: Response
            else Failure (retryable)
                Service-->>Retry: Error
                Note over Retry: Wait with backoff
            else Failure (non-retryable)
                Service-->>Retry: Fatal Error
                Retry-->>CB: Failure
                CB->>CB: Increment failure count
                CB-->>Client: Error
            end
        end
    else Circuit Open
        CB->>Fallback: Degraded Mode
        Fallback-->>CB: Fallback Response
        CB-->>Client: Fallback Response
    else Circuit Half-Open
        CB->>Service: Test Request
        alt Success
            Service-->>CB: Response
            CB->>CB: Close Circuit
            CB-->>Client: Response
        else Failure
            Service-->>CB: Error
            CB->>CB: Open Circuit
            CB-->>Client: Fallback Response
        end
    end
